  "description": "proposes an alternative Saga execution model, named Local Orchestration Saga (LOS), to address the distributed transaction challenge in microservice architectures. The goal of LOS is to combine the strengths of both Orchestrated and Choreographed Saga approaches—reducing central dependency while preserving process control and enabling more distributed workflow coordination.",
